  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkred pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Energetic Combustion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/7e/Fuego.png/revision/latest?cb=20130331181705\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Fuego\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/7e/Fuego.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20130331181705\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/7e/Fuego.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20130331181705 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/7e/Fuego.png/revision/latest?cb=20130331181705 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Fuego\" width=\"270\" height=\"233\" data-image-key=\"Fuego.png\" data-image-name=\"Fuego.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Fuego (Marvel Comics) absorbs energy from the environment to fuel his fire-based abilities.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb energy and convert it to combustion</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb energy and convert it towards combustion</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Fire Manipulation\">Fire Manipulation</a>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Combustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Energetic Volatility</li>\n<li>Pyric Capacitance</li>\n<li>Transduction Furnace</li>\n<li>Transduction Volatility</li>\n<li>Volatile Transduction</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Combustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb energy and convert it towards a self-combustion and volatile processes. They are capable of creating fire as well as fire-based elements from themselves and around them without issue. It is even possible to manipulate the forces that covert matter into energy and back again. They can also manipulate their personal volatile forces.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Combustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Fire Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Burning_Manipulation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bio-Burning Manipulation\">Bio-Burning Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Burning_Generation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bio-Burning Generation\">Bio-Burning Generation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Heat Manipulation\">Bio-Heat Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Pyric_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Pyric Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Pyric Energy Manipulation</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionization\" title=\"Bio-Ionization\">Bio-Ionization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Plasma_Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Plasma Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Plasma Fire Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Thermic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Thermic Manipulation\">Bio-Thermic Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Fire Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Thermochemistry_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Thermochemistry Manipulation\">Bio-Thermochemistry Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Activation_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Activation Manipulation\">Bio-Activation Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Equivalence_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Equivalence Manipulation\">Bio-Equivalence Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Kinetic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Kinetic Manipulation\">Bio-Kinetic Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Volatility_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Volatility Manipulation\">Bio-Volatility Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Entropy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Entropy Manipulation\">Bio-Entropy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Explosion_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Explosion Manipulation\">Bio-Explosion Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Fire Manipulation\">Fire Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Heat Manipulation\">Heat Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Magma Fire Manipulation\">Magma Fire Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Volatile_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Volatile Force Manipulation\">Volatile Force Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mass-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Mass-Energy Manipulation\">Mass-Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Pyric_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Pyric Dynamo\">Bio-Pyric Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Volatile_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Volatile Dynamo\">Bio-Volatile Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Equivalence\" title=\"Energetic Equivalence\">Energetic Equivalence</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Ionization\" title=\"Energetic Ionization\">Energetic Ionization</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Heating\" title=\"Energetic Heating\">Energetic Heating</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energized_Body\" title=\"Energized Body\">Energized Body</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Detection\" title=\"Energy Detection\">Energy Detection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Energy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Energy\">Personal Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Soul_Fire\" title=\"Personal Soul Fire\">Personal Soul Fire</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Soul_Heat\" title=\"Personal Soul Heat\">Personal Soul Heat</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Combustion\" title=\"Self-Combustion\">Self-Combustion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Pyric_Energy\" title=\"Personal Pyric Energy\">Personal Pyric Energy</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Power\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Power\">Personal Nuclear Power</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Ionization\" title=\"Personal Ionization\">Personal Ionization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Plasma_Fire\" title=\"Personal Plasma Fire\">Personal Plasma Fire</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Thermal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Thermal Radiation\">Personal Thermal Radiation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Fire\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Fire\">Personal Nuclear Fire</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self_Volatility\" title=\"Self Volatility\">Self Volatility</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Entropy\" title=\"Personal Entropy\">Personal Entropy</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Combustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermocombustion\" title=\"Thermocombustion\">Thermocombustion</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Combustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Ambient Energy Manipulation\">Ambient Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Capacitance_Manipulation\" title=\"Capacitance Manipulation\">Capacitance Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Manipulation\" title=\"Elemental Manipulation\">Elemental Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Sourcing\" title=\"Energy Sourcing\">Energy Sourcing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Fire Manipulation\">Fire Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Conversion\" title=\"Life-Force Conversion\">Life-Force Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Plasma_Manipulation\" title=\"Plasma Manipulation\">Plasma Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Combustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much energy user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in areas with a lack of energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Combustion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a tar